<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Node DHI | Enterprise API Engine</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #030408;
      --primary: #6366f1;
      --accent: #ec4899;
      --glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Ambient Background */
    .ambient {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: -1;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15), transparent 40%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15), transparent 40%);
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .badge {
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--primary);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      display: inline-block;
      animation: fadeIn 1s ease;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 5rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #fff 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      animation: slideUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: #94a3b8;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      animation: slideUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.1s forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .cta-group {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
      animation: slideUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.2s forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 1.25rem 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), #8b5cf6);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      color: #fff;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-top: 6rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1000px;
      animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease 0.4s forwards;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--glass);
      border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      border-radius: 32px;
      text-align: left;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--primary);
    }

    .feature-card i {
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    @keyframes slideUp {
      from { transform: translateY(40px); opacity: 0; }
      to { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 1; }
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      h1 { font-size: 3rem; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .cta-group { flex-direction: column; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ambient"></div>
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="badge">Version 2.0 Early Access</div>
    <h1>Enterprise Grade<br>API Engine</h1>
    <p>The ultimate Node.js foundation for high-performance applications. Built with Clean Architecture and hardened security.</p>
    
    <div class="cta-group">
      <a href="/admin" class="btn btn-primary">
        Launch Console <i data-lucide="arrow-right"></i>
      </a>
      <a href="/api-docs" class="btn btn-secondary">
        Documentation <i data-lucide="book-open"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="features">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
        <h3>Hardened Security</h3>
        <p>XSS, NoSQL Injection, and Rate Limiting built-in by default.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <i data-lucide="zap"></i>
        <h3>High Performance</h3>
        <p>Ultra-low latency response times with Redis caching integration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <i data-lucide="layers"></i>
        <h3>Clean Architecture</h3>
        <p>Maintainable, scalable, and fully decoupled business logic.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>